'''Ancient Weapons''' are a [[Value|tier]] of weapons added in by [[Nikilis]] in late 2016. It is a [[Value|tier]] below the [[Unique Weapons|Unique tier]] and a tier above the [[Godly Weapons|Godly tier]].

It is hinted that [[Nikilis]] may add more Ancient Weapons in later updates. So far, all ancient knives do not resemble actual knives or guns but resemble axes, scythes, hammers, crossbows, or snipers instead (except for [[Flames]], which was formerly an ancient.) Ancients are normally obtainable through holiday events, such as Halloween, Christmas, or Summer events.

Below is a list of all currently obtainable ancient weapons. 

