==Trivia ==   
*[[Flames]] used to be an Ancient weapon that could be obtained by [[crafting]]. Flames was soon changed to [[Godly Weapons|Godly]] after [[Season 1]] was released due to it being duplicated.
*There are currently 16 ancient weapons in the game.
*As of right now, there are four ancient guns in the game, those being [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Gingerscope]], and [[Emberbow]].
*All of the ancients from 2019 onwards were designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*[[Nikilis]], along with [[Zyleak]], have given away a weapon called "[[Nik's Scythe]]". However, only people trusted to [[Nikilis]] can own this weapon, and if another player owns it, it will be deleted from their inventory.
*[[Harvester]] is the first ancient gun in the game, [[Icepiercer]] was the second and [[Gingerscope]] was the third.
*[[Reaver]] and [[Harvester]] were released at the same time. [[Icepiercer]] and [[Icecrusher]] were also released at the same time. [[Gingerscythe]] and [[Gingerscope]] were also released at the same time.
*[[Reaver]] is the first [[Evo Weapons|EVO]] weapon to be released and is untradeable.
*There currently are no [[Evo Weapons|EVO]] guns in game.
*[[Reaver]] is the first and only scythe to be double-bladed.
*[[Icecrusher]] is the first and currently the only hammer ancient, it is also the first [[Evo Weapons|evo]] knife to be a leaderboard trophy, the second one being [[Gingerscythe]], and the third being [[Synthwave]].
*[[Emberscythe]] and [[Emberbow]] were the first ancients to receive [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterparts.
*Most of the Ancient Weapons are scythes or bows.
*Ancient weapons have never been obtainable through unboxing. 
